Self-hosted web fonts for NephroSite
====================================

Families: Blinker, Blaka, Fenix (latin + latin-ext WOFF2 subsets).
Source: Google Fonts CDN snapshots (fonts.gstatic.com), 2026-11-05.
License: SIL Open Font License 1.1 — see OFL-Blinker.ofl, OFL-Blaka.ofl,
         OFL-Fenix.ofl in this directory.

Reserved Font Name for Fenix: 'Fenix' (Fernando Diaz).
Loaded via /css/fonts.css with font-display: swap.

Note: WebSupport blocks public .txt; licenses use the .ofl extension
(served as text/plain) so attribution stays reachable over HTTP.
